<title>POLAND: Slaski revises down its 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Slaski revises down its 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Slaski results for the year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    805.03 vs    749.91</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			411.08 vs    398.72</p>
<p>    net profit			    288.40 vs    242.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Slaski SA. Earlier the bank reported its net profit at 306 million zlotys and interest and similar revenues at 1,375.3 million. @</p>
<p>interest and similar revenues 1,305.52  vs 1,120.16</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	726.56  vs   580.62</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  215.32  vs   185.74</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  10.68  vs    12.75</p>
<p>    income tax			    122.68   vs  156.30</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
